1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:06,400
My mother was born in Oran in 1931.

2
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:12,200
She was eleven when they left. She never saw the house again.

3
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:17,000
They took two suitcases and the photographs.

4
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:23,800
In 1962 we arrived in Marseille with 400 francs between the five of us.

5
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:29,000
My father found work at the port. My mother did not speak for a year.

6
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:33,200
She started again at forty-three, in a language she had to learn.

7
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:38,000
I was told this once, and I never asked again.
